    {
      "scene_no": 5,
      "template_id": "column_comparison",
      "teacher_script": "Let's put them side-by-side to clearly see the difference. Like fractions are incredibly convenient for basic operations because their 'pieces' are the same size. Unlike fractions, however, require an extra step of finding a common denominator before you can add or subtract them effectively. This is where understanding their difference becomes crucial!",
